<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lankan stock market closed for holiday.</title>
<headline>Sri Lankan stock market closed for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Sri Lankan stock market was closed on Friday for a Moslem religious holiday.</p>
<p>On Thursday, the Colombo Stock Exchange All Share Index ended 2.47 points down at 817.53, with price gains nudging declines by 30 to 24 as investors waited on the sidelines ahead of interim corporate results, due shortly.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
